<title>USA: Cavalier Homes Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Cavalier Homes Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA FALLS, Texas 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.43		    $0.22</p>
<p> Net		 5,361		    2,612</p>
<p> Revs		91,890		   73,568</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  12,364		   11,895</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.25		    $0.79</p>
<p> Net		 15,366		   9,020</p>
<p> Revs		348,748		  274,250</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  12,258		   11,486</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 and full year 1996 results include non-recurring gain of $1.75 million, or $0.14 per share, from life insurance proceeds.</p>
<p>Earnings per share and average shares outstanding for both 1995 periods have been adjusted for a 3-for-2 stock split in February 1996 and a 5-for-4 split in November 1996.</p>
</text>
